Z||000018||AusFiero||05-25-2001||04:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jay:<BR><B>You mean to tell me not everyone uses cable?  I know the 14.4 modems are cheep but come on!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Trust me, given the opportunity I would be on cable too. But our nice phone company assured me oh yes cable is going through that area. So I bought land and built my house. Got a year of assurances it would come through. Then the bastards canned the idea. So now I am stuck with a measly 56k permanent dialup connection even though my estate is full of now unused Fibre Optics. <P>I suppose I don't have to ring up all the time but I was not impressed about lack of cable as I run my internet business from home.<P>But the irony of it all is if I lived less than a mile north it would be available. GRRRRRRRRRR<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||13
